+
+## Subtopics
+
+### Animatable Neural Radiance Fields (ANRF)
+A skeleton-driven approach for human model reconstruction from multi-view videos, maintaining a canonical space and estimating two-way correspondences [S1, unofficial]. It uses a new motion representation, the neural blend weight field, combined with 3D human skeletons for deformation field generation. Human meshes can be extracted by running marching cubes on volume densities at discretized canonical space points [S1, unofficial].
 
